  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 9 月，Wintermute 的金库被盗，约 1.6 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 9 月，Wintermute 的金库被盗，约 1.6 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.721
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "这个金库的地址，是用一个叫 Profanity 的靶号工具生成的。",
   "spoken": "这个金库的地址，是用一个叫 Profanity 的靶号工具生成的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.788,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 6.886,
   "speechEnd": 10.933
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "靶号地址，就是首尾字符符合指定模式的地址。比如开头是一串 0。",
   "spoken": "靶号地址，就是首尾字符符合指定模式的地址。比如开头是一串 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.976,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 12.074,
   "speechEnd": 18.464
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "私钥有 256 位，按理说，没人猜得出来。",
   "spoken": "私钥有 256 位，按理说，没人猜得出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.516,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 19.614,
   "speechEnd": 23.042
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "可这个工具的随机数，只用了一个 32 位的种子。",
   "spoken": "可这个工具的随机数，只用了一个 32 位的种子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.104,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 24.202,
   "speechEnd": 27.38
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "32 位种子，只有约 43 亿种可能。",
   "spoken": "32 位种子，只有约 43 亿种可能。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.452,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 28.55,
   "speechEnd": 31.359
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "做个示例计算。如果每秒试 10 亿个种子，全部试完，最多约 4.3 秒。",
   "spoken": "做个示例计算。如果每秒试 10 亿个种子，全部试完，最多约 4.3 秒。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.416,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 32.514,
   "speechEnd": 38.297
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "真实攻击还要从种子算出地址，会慢一些。但一张 GPU，几分钟就够。",
   "spoken": "真实攻击还要从种子算出地址，会慢一些。但一张 GPU，几分钟就够。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.356,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 39.454,
   "speechEnd": 45.546
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "那么问题来了。一把 256 位的私钥，为什么只值 32 位？",
   "spoken": "那么问题来了。一把 256 位的私钥，为什么只值 32 位？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.608,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 46.706,
   "speechEnd": 51.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "这一集，我们讲私钥从哪里来，又是怎么被算出来的。",
